IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P4-gate`
IMPORT `P4-art-28`

-- Tests of Article 28. Expected values are written from the text of Article 28 (consolidated lines 530-544), never from the encoding's output.
-- Chapter III Section 4 applies from 2 August 2025 (Art 113 third paragraph point (b)): a case before (1 August 2025), on, and after.
-- The Omnibus entered into force on 27 July 2026: paragraphs 8 and 9 exist only from then.

§ `The gates`

#ASSERT NOT (`Art 28 to 39 the notified bodies group applies on the date asked` (Date 1 8 2025))
#ASSERT `Art 28 to 39 the notified bodies group applies on the date asked` (Date 2 8 2025)
#ASSERT `Art 28 to 39 the notified bodies group applies on the date asked` (Date 1 12 2026)
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 28 to 39 the notified bodies group applies on the date asked` (Date 1 1 2024))
#ASSERT `Art 28 to 39 the answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 28 to 39 the answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 28 to 39 the answer when the group applies` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 28 to 39 the maybe-answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2025) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 28 to 39 the maybe-answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2025) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 28 to 39 the date the number of months after` (Date 30 11 2025) 3 EQUALS Date 28 2 2026
#ASSERT `Art 28 to 39 the date the number of months after` (Date 15 1 2026) 3 EQUALS Date 15 4 2026

-- Annex VII's gate: group General from 2 August 2026 (as amended), a high-risk system, not saved by Art 111(2).
`the Annex III route` MEANS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex VII the group of Article 43 applies to the AI system on the date asked` (Date 1 8 2026) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2028) FALSE)
#ASSERT `Annex VII the group of Article 43 applies to the AI system on the date asked` (Date 2 8 2026) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2028) FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex VII the group of Article 43 applies to the AI system on the date asked` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route neither` (Date 1 1 2028) FALSE)
-- Art 111(2): placed before 2 December 2027 (the date of application of Chapter III for an Annex III system) and not significantly changed: saved
#ASSERT NOT (`Annex VII the group of Article 43 applies to the AI system on the date asked` (Date 2 8 2028) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE)
#ASSERT `Annex VII the group of Article 43 applies to the AI system on the date asked` (Date 2 8 2028) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE
-- RECONCILED 2026-11-17: was #ASSERT `Annex VII the answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2026) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2028) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE; the helper takes the Section B flag and the integration flag of the keel's Article 2(2) after the four gate inputs (fork F-S14-reach); both FALSE here, the expected value is unchanged
#ASSERT `Annex VII the answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2026) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2028) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- RECONCILED 2026-11-17: was #ASSERT `Annex VII the answer when the group applies` (Date 1 8 2026) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2028) FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING; the helper takes the Section B flag and the integration flag of the keel's Article 2(2) after the four gate inputs (fork F-S14-reach); both FALSE here, the expected value is unchanged
#ASSERT `Annex VII the answer when the group applies` (Date 1 8 2026) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2028) FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- RECONCILED 2026-11-17: was #ASSERT `Annex VII the maybe-answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2026) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2028) FALSE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING; the helper takes the Section B flag and the integration flag of the keel's Article 2(2) after the four gate inputs (fork F-S14-reach); both FALSE here, the expected value is unchanged
#ASSERT `Annex VII the maybe-answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2026) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2028) FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- RECONCILED 2026-11-17: was #ASSERT `Annex VII the maybe-answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2026) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2028) FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE; the helper takes the Section B flag and the integration flag of the keel's Article 2(2) after the four gate inputs (fork F-S14-reach); both FALSE here, the expected value is unchanged
#ASSERT `Annex VII the maybe-answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2026) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2028) FALSE FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- RECONCILED 2026-11-17: was #ASSERT `Annex VII the maybe-answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route neither` (Date 1 1 2028) FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING; the helper takes the Section B flag and the integration flag of the keel's Article 2(2) after the four gate inputs (fork F-S14-reach); both FALSE here, the expected value is unchanged
#ASSERT `Annex VII the maybe-answer when the group applies` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route neither` (Date 1 1 2028) FALSE FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 28(1)`

-- args: date asked, the Member State has designated or established at least one notifying authority, the procedures were developed in cooperation
#ASSERT `Art 28(1) the Member State has met the duty to designate or establish a notifying authority` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 28(1) the Member State has met the duty to designate or establish a notifying authority` (Date 1 12 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 28(1) the Member State has met the duty to designate or establish a notifying authority` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 28(1) the Member State has met the duty to designate or establish a notifying authority` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 28(1) the Member State has met the duty to designate or establish a notifying authority` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- The duty as a rule: no time limit, so it cannot be breached; it is fulfilled by the act, and nothing is owed before 2 August 2025.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 28(1) the duty of the Member State to designate or establish a notifying authority` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 28 Member State` DOES `Art 28(1) designate or establish at least one notifying authority` AT 5
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 28(1) the duty of the Member State to designate or establish a notifying authority` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 28(1) the duty of the Member State to designate or establish a notifying authority` (Date 1 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400

