-- args: date asked, a national accreditation body within Regulation (EC) No 765/2008, acting in accordance with it
#ASSERT `Art 28(2) the Member State may decide that the assessment and monitoring are carried out by a national accreditation body` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 28(2) the Member State may decide that the assessment and monitoring are carried out by a national accreditation body` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 28(2) the Member State may decide that the assessment and monitoring are carried out by a national accreditation body` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 28(2) the Member State may decide that the assessment and monitoring are carried out by a national accreditation body` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 28(2) the Member State may decide that the assessment and monitoring are carried out by a national accreditation body` (Date 1 12 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE

§ `Article 28(3)`

-- args: date asked, no conflict of interest arises, objectivity and impartiality safeguarded
#ASSERT `Art 28(3) the notifying authority is established, organised and operated as required` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 28(3) the notifying authority is established, organised and operated as required` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 28(3) the notifying authority is established, organised and operated as required` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 28(3) the notifying authority is established, organised and operated as required` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 28(3) the notifying authority is established, organised and operated as required` (Date 1 12 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE

§ `Article 28(4)`

-- args: date asked, decisions taken by competent persons, those persons differ from those who carried out the assessment
#ASSERT `Art 28(4) the notifying authority is organised as required` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 28(4) the notifying authority is organised as required` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 28(4) the notifying authority is organised as required` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 28(4) the notifying authority is organised as required` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 28(4) the notifying authority is organised as required` (Date 1 12 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE

§ `Article 28(5)`

-- args: date asked, offers or provides an activity that bodies perform, offers or provides consultancy on a commercial or competitive basis
#ASSERT `Art 28(5) the notifying authority has kept to the bar on offering or providing activities and consultancy` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 28(5) the notifying authority has kept to the bar on offering or providing activities and consultancy` (Date 2 8 2025) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 28(5) the notifying authority has kept to the bar on offering or providing activities and consultancy` (Date 2 8 2025) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 28(5) the notifying authority has kept to the bar on offering or providing activities and consultancy` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 28(5) the notifying authority has kept to the bar on offering or providing activities and consultancy` (Date 1 12 2026) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE

-- The breach path: the forbidden act occurs.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 28(5) the bar on the notifying authority offering or providing an activity that conformity assessment bodies perform` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 28 notifying authority` DOES `Art 28(5) offer or provide an activity that conformity assessment bodies perform` AT 3
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 28(5) the bar on the notifying authority offering or providing an activity that conformity assessment bodies perform` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 400
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 28(5) the bar on the notifying authority offering or providing consultancy services on a commercial or competitive basis` (Date 2 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 28 notifying authority` DOES `Art 28(5) offer or provide consultancy services on a commercial or competitive basis` AT 3
-- Not yet applicable: the same act is no breach.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 28(5) the bar on the notifying authority offering or providing consultancy services on a commercial or competitive basis` (Date 1 8 2025) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `Art 28 notifying authority` DOES `Art 28(5) offer or provide consultancy services on a commercial or competitive basis` AT 3

