§ `Article 28(8): both versions, on each side of 27 July 2026`

-- The text as amended, tested through its own function (no date, no gate).
-- args: authority responsible for Section A AI systems, body applies under both, legislation provides single application, possibility given, unified assessment undergone, authorities cooperate
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) as amended first subparagraph the notifying authority has ensured the single application and the unified assessment` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) as amended first subparagraph the notifying authority has ensured the single application and the unified assessment` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) as amended first subparagraph the notifying authority has ensured the single application and the unified assessment` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) as amended first subparagraph the notifying authority has ensured the single application and the unified assessment` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) as amended first subparagraph the notifying authority has ensured the single application and the unified assessment` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) as amended first subparagraph the notifying authority has ensured the single application and the unified assessment` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) as amended first subparagraph the notifying authority has ensured the single application and the unified assessment` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The dispatcher: the day before the Omnibus (26 July 2026) the text as enacted has no paragraph 8; from 27 July 2026 it does.
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) first subparagraph the notifying authority has ensured the single application and the unified assessment` (Date 26 7 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) first subparagraph the notifying authority has ensured the single application and the unified assessment` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) first subparagraph the notifying authority has ensured the single application and the unified assessment` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) first subparagraph the notifying authority has ensured the single application and the unified assessment` (Date 27 7 2026) FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) first subparagraph the notifying authority has ensured the single application and the unified assessment` (Date 1 8 2025) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- Second subparagraph: args: date asked, already designated under Section A legislation, applies under this Regulation, legislation provides such a procedure, made available
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) as amended second subparagraph the single application and the unified assessment are made available to a notified body already designated` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) as amended second subparagraph the single application and the unified assessment are made available to a notified body already designated` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) as amended second subparagraph the single application and the unified assessment are made available to a notified body already designated` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) as amended second subparagraph the single application and the unified assessment are made available to a notified body already designated` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) second subparagraph the single application and the unified assessment are made available to a notified body already designated` (Date 26 7 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) second subparagraph the single application and the unified assessment are made available to a notified body already designated` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) second subparagraph the single application and the unified assessment are made available to a notified body already designated` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- Third subparagraph, first sentence: one application.
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) as amended third subparagraph the number of times the body has to apply for designation pursuant to this Regulation` TRUE EQUALS JUST 1
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) as amended third subparagraph the number of times the body has to apply for designation pursuant to this Regulation` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) third subparagraph the number of times the body has to apply for designation pursuant to this Regulation` (Date 26 7 2026) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 28(8) third subparagraph the number of times the body has to apply for designation pursuant to this Regulation` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST 1
